    "L'autre appareil a envoyé une partie que celui-ci ne sait pas lire. Installez la même version de Riskelo des deux côtés.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The other device sent a game this one cannot read. Install the same version of Riskelo on both sides."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La conquête de %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@'s conquest"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La liaison est bonne : c'est le lancement qui n'arrive pas. Celui qui a ouvert la partie doit toucher « Commencer ».": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The link is good: it is the launch that is not arriving. Whoever opened the game has to tap “Start”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La liaison est bonne : c'est le lancement qui n'arrive pas. Vérifiez que %@ a bien touché « Commencer », et que les deux appareils ont la même version de Riskelo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The link is good: it is the launch that is not arriving. Check that %@ really tapped “Start”, and that both devices have the same version of Riskelo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La liaison est tombée": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The link dropped"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La liaison n'a pas pu s'établir": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The link could not be established"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La partie est rangée : vous la retrouverez à l'accueil.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The game is put away: you will find it on the home screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La partie reprendra toute seule. Encore %lld s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The game will resume on its own. %lld s to go."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La remplir gagne la partie, sur-le-champ. Il n'y a pas d'autre porte : aucun nombre de territoires ne gagne la partie.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filling it wins the game, on the spot. There is no other gate: no number of territories wins the game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
