    "Le dé est remplacé par une question.\nL'attaquant choisit le terrain, le défenseur répond.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The die is replaced by a question.\nThe attacker picks the ground, the defender answers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le dé est remplacé par une question.\nLes deux la reçoivent : le plus sûr, ou le plus vif, l'emporte.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The die is replaced by a question.\nBoth receive it: the surer, or the quicker, wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le système a refusé d'ouvrir le réseau local.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system refused to open the local network."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les Marches": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Marches"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les appareils doivent être proches. Ni compte ni réseau : le Bluetooth ou le Wi-Fi suffisent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The devices have to be close by. No account, no network: Bluetooth or Wi-Fi is enough."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les autres appareils ne montrent que la leur.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The other devices show only their own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les deux appareils n'ont pas la même version de Riskelo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The two devices are not running the same version of Riskelo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les deux savent : le sablier tranche. Aucun des deux : la place tient, comme sur une égalité de dés.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both know: the clock settles it. Neither of them: the place holds, as on a tie of dice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les questions, les menus et le mode d'emploi suivent ensemble.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questions, menus and the manual all follow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
